Z||000000||fogglethorpe||10-21-2001||08:10 PM||||"Would you like to buy something from my Christmas Around the World catalogue?" <BR>actually means:<BR>"Would you like to buy some useless, over-priced crap that nobody needs, to support a cause that nobody cares about?"<P>"The check is in the mail." <BR>actually means:<BR>"You'll never get paid for this!"<P>"I've never met a girl like you, and I deeply respect you."<BR>actually means:<BR>"I want to boink you."<P>"This car was owned by a little old lady."<BR>actually means:<BR>"This car was owned by a little old lady, whose grandson borrowed it and drove it like a motocross bike."<P>"I didn't do it, Dad."<BR>actually means:<BR>"I did it, Dad."<P>"Thanks for a wonderful evening."<BR>actually means:<BR>"I would rather poke myself in the eye with a #2 pencil than subject myself to one more minute of your excruciating vacation slides!"<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||maryjane||10-21-2001||09:25 PM||||Now YOU KNOW people always mean what they say<BR>and say what they mean to say and mean IT too. Am I being mean? Don't mean to be mean, just mean to be clear, not mean. I mean....well, I forgot.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||AusFiero||10-21-2001||09:38 PM||||Some real estate ones.<BR>Great views = Yes it does have windows<BR>In a quality neighbourhood = Or it was 50 years ago<BR>Renovated kitchen and bathroom = With the cheapest possible fittings we could find.<BR>Suit handyman = Ready for demolition.<BR>Riverfront property = Occasonally it becomes part of the river.<BR>Deceased estate, will sell cheap = We couldn't get all the blood stains out but it was only 1 little murder.<BR>Large 2 car garage = Will fit 2 really small cars with some effort.<BR>Full of character = Full of mould and debris.<BR>Has skylight = Holes in the roof free.<BR>Beachside property = The back yard has been washed away in the last storm and the house will be next.<BR>Ocean views = If you lean out the upstairs bathroom window a long way.<BR>Great investment property = We are losing big on it so you can too.<BR>Will rent for $400 a week = Will rent for $100 a week.<BR>Astute investor sought = Looking for an idiot to take it off our hands.<BR>Could use a lick of paint = If you lick the old lead based paint flaking off the walls now you could die.<BR>Call now or you could miss out = Please call, PLEASE!!!<BR>Full security system and window grills = Everything in this neighbourhood gets stolen if it isn't bolted down.<BR>Suit student rental = It wouldn't be possible to damage it anymore than it already is.<BR>Breath taking views = Next to a cyanide processing plant (will certainly take the breath away).<BR>Old world charm = Needs new wiring and plumbing.<BR>Quiet location = Except when the motorcycle gang next door start up all 100 Harleys at once. <BR>Fully landscaped grounds = We bought a garden gnome and 3 plants before we put it on the market.<BR>Beautiful water feature =  The yard has regressed to the swamp it once was.<BR>Surrounded by nature = The middle of nowhere.<BR>Close to transport = Positioned on a major highway.<P>I have been making these up as I go. I might stop now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero2.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
